## **Device Changelog** ##

**marble (01/03/2025)**

```bash
- Upstream kernel
- Update common blobs from diting V816.0.10.0.ULFMIXM
- Update and Cleanup overlays
- Update display, GPS and QCC blobs from ingot UKQ1.240227.165
- Build and configure xiaomi touch hal for high touch sampling rate
- Remove duplicate snxxx AIDL rules
- Switch to common QCOM AIDL bootctrl HAL
- Implement torch strength control
- Import missing camera libs for noise reduction
- Add migration to turn off persist.vendor.radio.poweron_opt
- Cleanup rootdir scripts
- Misc improvements
```

**marble (11/01/2025)**

```bash
- Upstream kernel
- Fixed MiuiCamera
- Update marble blobs, firmware, fingerprint and miuicamera from V816.0.14.0.UMRMIXM
- Add missing 32-bit libvmmem
- Misc improvements
```

**marble (01/01/2025)**

```bash
- Upstream kernel
- Update common blobs from diting V816.0.9.0.ULFMIXM
- Update marble blobs, firmware and fingerprint from V816.0.12.0.UMRMIXM
- Set frame rate multiple threshold to 120Hz
- Move to new xiaomi touch (touch freeze should be fixed now)
