**marble (18/11/2024)**

```bash
- Initial Release
- Upstream kernel
- Updated common blobs from diting V816.0.8.0.ULFMIXM
- Updated marble blobs from V816.0.10.0.UMRMIXM
- Switched fingerprint, USB & thermal HALs to AIDL
- Migrate sensor HAL to AIDL interface
- Add v2 suffix to sensors.xiaomi
- Move to Xiaomi IR AIDL
- Shim WFD with libgui_shim/libinput_shim
- Add missing displayconfig for 0b panel
- Get rid of 32 bit blobs
